#: mvc/app/views/OPNsense/PolicyAnalyzer/reports_body.volt:188
msgid ""
"The AI only summarises and recommends. Saving, importing and sending always "
"show a simulation first; saved settings are recorded in the action history "
"of the Policy Analyzer and can be reverted there. The Monit password is "
"never shown, copied to the browser or written to a log."
